msgid "Distinct crates with recorded activity during the selected period. The chart shows distinct crates per day, not a cumulative total. Identity uses recorded root, name and kind, not a complete workspace inventory. Paths are not normalized; build configurations are not distinguished. Missing observations do not establish removals."
